Using the deliver-story skill, deliver the eligible stories of the current sprint in dev_minions/backlog/ one at a time. The goal is met when every story of the current sprint is Awaiting QA, Done or Blocked in dev_minions/status.md, or no story is eligible because the remaining ones wait on the user (decision, QA or escalation), AND dev_minions/HANDOVER.md is committed and describes the state and next step. Prove it at the end by printing the sprint rows of status.md and git log --oneline -3. Stop early, after running the handover skill, if a product or design decision is needed, or after 60 turns.
